# Configuration-only changes

If only the runtime configuration changes, such as:

```text
LLM_PROVIDER
BEDROCK_MODEL_ID
EPIC_READS_ENABLED
EPIC_TEST_PATIENT_IDS
PUBLIC_DEMO_ACCESS
```

you normally do not need to build a new image.

Update the EC2 runtime configuration, then restart only:

```bash
cd /mnt/shiftweave
docker compose up -d app
```

Still verify health, readiness, and MCP.

